        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Mumbai/scene_mongoose.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 80051c02-e026-40fe-970a-7b7aaa62302c).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Mumbai 47,\r\rIronically you are tasked today with preventing an assassination.\r\r&quot;The Kashmirian&quot;, bankrolled by Neha Kale and Rima Shah, has been contracted to assassinate Mr Saharan, who arrives tonight, due to his wealth, high caste status and British social connections.\r\rGurdeep Gokhale, the owner of the local laundromat, furnished &quot;Loftur&quot; with a bodyguard outfit so that they may gather insider information on Mr Saharan. Accordingly, so too must they both be eliminated.",
